			"notes": "# BIG WARNING\nThe block and item id arcane_linen_hay has been changed to arcane_linen_bale, so remove them from worlds and craft normal items from them to avoid losing blocks.\n\n# small warning\nWizard's Reborn uses the Fusion Connected Textures mod for some blocks, this dependency is optional.  \nFusion project recently had structure rewritten, which is why some Java package paths are now different.  \nFluffy Fur creates its own predicate for Fusion's connected textures, which means I'll have to update the library to make it work on the latest versions.  \nHowever, due to Fusion updates, some parameters and render types for some blocks in Wizard's Reborn were broken and missing textures were displayed.  \nAaand I don't like this at all. And since Wizard's Reborn depends on Fluffy Fur, I've decided to release the unfinished Wizard's Reborn update version 0.3. This is what it is as of now.  \nSome content is unfinished, some is completed, and some is completed but unavailable in survival due to other content being unfinished.  \n\nI wanted this very large update to come out as planned and polished, but it took me a very long time to make and I was getting in the way of other projects, programming, engineering, and studying.  \nBecause this update took so long to make, I felt guilty that people who are waiting can't get it.. and I think I'll feel better after this.\n\nPlease read the big warning in the changelog before updating the mod.  \nAnd.. uh.. enjoy?\n\nThis is a completely incomplete changelog that i had written in a \"Wizard's Reborn Tasts.txt\" file on my PC:  \nAdded Cargo Carpets block  \nAdded a lot of food  \nAdded Arcane Wood Crossbow  \nAdded Arcane Wood Fishing Rod  \nAdded Arcane Gold Shears  \nAdded Silk Song Arcane Enchantment(TOMORROW)  \nAdded Propelling Arcane Enchantment  \nAdded Firework Jump Arcane Enchantment  \nReplaced some vanilla items with tags in recipes  \nFixed Salt Campfire sound when disabled  \nFixed baulk blocks ambient occlusion  \nFixed wissen wand shows bar scale incorrectly"
		},
